# Out of scope

Coordinate: 1.1.1/1.1.1/1.1.15

AMD AI League (lablab.ai): Individual participation only - the event page answers 'Can I play in a team? No' - and its final build Match ends Nov 14, 2026, before the campaign window effectively opens; only league points/courses accrue until Dec 1, 2026 (podium $2,500 / $1,500 / $1,000). Out of scope for the team sweep unless Will plays it personally as a solo side-entry.

The research scan also recorded 18 near-misses (closed, student-only, partner-restricted, in-person, or off-theme events, each with its reason and source). They are not itemized here; the full list lives in the research report: ~/workspace/research_notes/online-ai-hackathons-nov2026-feb2027-20261111-0314/report.md (working notes in its notes/ folder). Platform negatives worth remembering: no lablab.ai event runs fully inside the window; no AI-focused online MLH event exists in the window; no Kaggle competition with a February 2027 deadline was found.
